{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42379","headline":"太傅相公以庭梅二篇许舍弟同赋再迂藻思曲有虚称谨依韵奉和庶申感谢 · 徐铉","name":"太傅相公以庭梅二篇许舍弟同赋再迂藻思曲有虚称谨依韵奉和庶申感谢","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旧眷终无替，流光自足悲。\n攀条感花萼，和曲许埙篪。\n前会成春梦，和人更己知。\n缘情聊借喻，争取道言诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42379.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42379","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}